    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-Replace Events Ticketing Tickets Transfer-v4-spec",
    "description": "This API facilitates the transfer of event tickets between users, enabling seamless sharing of tickets within a marketplace or between friends. It allows ticket holders to initiate and complete the transfer process, ensuring that tickets are accurately updated in the system. Typical consumers include event organizers, ticketing platforms, and users holding multiple tickets who wish to share them. With this API, developers can easily integrate ticket transfer functionality into their applications, improving user experience and event accessibility.",
